# ============================================================================
# PUBLISH ALLOWLIST — only the Go engine goes to GitHub.
#
# Everything is ignored by default (/*); the !-entries below are the ONLY
# things git tracks. Documentation (products_docs/), test harnesses, reports,
# task automations, and working aids stay on disk. To publish something new,
# add an explicit !-line here — nothing leaks by accident.
# ============================================================================
/*

# --- the Go module (source of the `gateway` binary) ------------------------
!/cmd/
!/internal/
!/migrations/
!/scripts/
!/go.mod
!/go.sum

# lib/: the SMPP and encoding modules — go.mod's replace lines need them to
# build (PO, 8 Nov 2026).
!/lib/

# The two benchmark tools, so anyone can reproduce BENCHMARKS.md against an
# install made by `yakugate migrate --seed` (account `loadtest`). Only these
# two folders of sqa/ — the rest (harnesses, fixtures, results) stays local
# (PO, 8 Nov 2026).
!/sqa/
/sqa/*
!/sqa/load/
/sqa/load/*
!/sqa/load/smppbench/
!/sqa/load/httpbench/

# migrations/ + scripts/ look like data but are REQUIRED to build:
# the binary embeds them via go:embed (migrations/embed.go, scripts/embed.go).

# --- minimum public repo surface --------------------------------------------
!/README.md
!/BENCHMARKS.md
!/INSTALL.md
!/LICENSE
!/Makefile
!/yakugate.config.example
!/.gitignore

# --- hard excludes: never publish, even inside whitelisted folders ----------
# secrets
.env
.env.*
yakugate.config
yakugate.config.bak
sms.config
sms.config.bak
*.pem
*.key
# tests: no automated tests, cases, results, or harnesses in the public repo
*_test.go
testcases*
*.postman_collection.json
test-report*
report.md
# documentation: only the root README is public
migrations/**/*.md
# Claude's notes: a CLAUDE.md sits in internal/ (and other folders) since
# 2026-10-08 — never public, at any depth
CLAUDE.md
# artifacts & working files
*.log
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.zip
__pycache__/
private/
references/
CONTINUE.md

# --- explicit (already covered by /*, listed so intent is unmissable) -------
# products_docs/  -> ALL product documentation, specs, test cases & results
# admin/          -> Node.js Admin API (never published from this repo)
# portal/         -> React portal (never published from this repo)
# _to_delete/ .claude/ CLAUDE.md deploy/ configs/ -> local only
